OL,5,G1900 GPs: Behind Closed Doors
OL,6,     FThere are dramatic scenes when Dr
OL,7,     FKhan tries to remove a patient's
OL,8,     Fingrowing toe nails and a
OL,9,     Fstrapping plumber goes weak at the
OL,10,     Fknees at the sight of a needle.
OL,11,G2000 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,12,     FDuring a packed shift, a
OL,13,     F53-year-old chef suffers chest
OL,14,     Fpains, an 84-year-old has had a
OL,15,     Ffall on an escalator, and a
OL,16,     Ffarmer's been crushed by a bull
OL,17,     Ffrom his herd.
